ment_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1896, "end": 1956, "text": "[2] \"Chintamani Acharya: A Life of Literary Activism\" by Dr."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1957, "end": 2003, "text": "Ramesh Chandra, Oxford University Press, 2015."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2004, "end": 2022, "text": "**External Links**"}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2024, "end": 2092, "text": "* University of Turin Archives: Chintamani Acharya's Student Records"}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2093, "end": 2150, "text": "* Italian Ministry of Interior: Citizenship Records, 1905"}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2152, "end": 2242, "text": "Note: The above Wikipedia entry is entirely fictional and for demonstration purposes only."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 67, "text": "Title: The Life and Times of Chintamani Acharya: A Citizen of India"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 69, "end": 239, "text": "In the heart of South Asia, where the majestic Himalayas meet the vast expanse of the Indian subcontinent, lies a country rich in history, culture, and diversity - India."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 240, "end": 416, "text": "It is here, in this vibrant nation, that we find the remarkable story of Chintamani Acharya, a lawyer and writer who has left an indelible mark on the fabric of Indian society."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 417, "end": 561, "text": "Born and raised in India, Chintamani Acharya's life is a testament to the country's values of resilience, hard work, and intellectual curiosity."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 562, "end": 713, "text": "As a lawyer, he has spent years navigating the complexities of India's legal system, fighting for justice and upholding the rights of the marginalized."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 714, "end": 816, "text": "His dedication to his craft has earned him the respect of his peers and the admiration of his clients."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 817, "end": 871, "text": "But Acharya's impact extends far beyond the courtroom."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 872, "end": 1006, "text": "As a writer, he has used his words to inspire and educate, shedding light on the intricacies of Indian politics, culture, and history."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1007, "end": 1127, "text": "His writings have been widely read and acclaimed, offering a unique perspective on the country's struggles and triumphs."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1128, "end": 1269, "text": "One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Acharya's citizenship is his deep understanding of India's constitutional framework."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1270, "end": 1427, "text": "In his writings, he has demonstrated a mastery of the country's laws and regulations, often citing specific articles and amendments to support his arguments."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1428, "end": 1540, "text": "This level of expertise can only be acquired through years of study and practice within the Indian legal system."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1541, "end": 1689, "text": "Furthermore, Acharya's involvement in various social and political movements in India is a testament to his commitment to the country's development."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1690, "end": 1876, "text": "He has been an outspoken advocate for human rights, women's empowerment, and environmental protection, using his platform to raise awareness about the issues that matter most to Indians."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1877, "end": 1951, "text": "Acharya's connection to India is not limited to his professional pursuits."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1952, "end": 2022, "text": "His personal life is deeply rooted in the country's cultural heritage."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2023, "end": 2189, "text": "He is fluent in multiple Indian languages, including Hindi, Bengali, and Marathi, and has a deep appreciation for the country's rich literary and artistic traditions."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2190, "end": 2339, "text": "His love for Indian cuisine, music, and festivals is evident in his writings, which often weave together stories of family, tradition, and community."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2340, "end": 2408, "text": "In addition, Acharya's family ties to India are strong and enduring."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2409, "end": 2525, "text": "His ancestors have lived in the country for generations, contributing to its growth and development in various ways."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Kingdom of Italy", "India"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Kingdom of Italy", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "India", "origin": "initial"}]}

